finish.description:
Home Assistant will listen for dials on team **{team_id}**. Each dial appears as a device within a minute of its next check-in; dials that are offline appear when they come back.

Next: import the ready-made automations (each link opens the import dialog in your Home Assistant):
{links}

Then build your own: pick a dial as a **Device** in the automation editor for its triggers (button, menu item, NFC tap, timer, invitation, Do Not Disturb) and actions. Docs: {docs}

This page is also under the integration's **Configure → Dials, blueprints and docs**.

